      "role": "user",
      "content": "Fine. What about Marcus Vane? His resume is objectively the strongest of the bunch, but I've got some reservations after seeing some of his interview notes. He seems a bit... structured. Methodical. I'm worried he's going to try to slow us down with processes when we need someone to just run with it. Does he actually have the drive we need, or is he too soft for this?",
